dress></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>NAKAJIMA TAKESHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TANAKA KANJI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>HASHIZUME, NAOKI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NAKAJIMA, TAKESHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TANAKA, KANJI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>An optical multiplexer/demultiplexer (1) comprises a plurality of first waveguides (3), a first slab waveguide (4), an array-waveguide diffraction grating (5) with a plurality of waveguides, a second slab waveguide (6) and a plurality of second waveguides (7), and the waveguides are connected in that order.  The ratio of the interval between the first waveguides (3) in the connection with the first slab waveguide (4) to the interval between the second waveguides (7) in the connection with the second slab waveguide (6) is different from the ratio of the focal distance of the first slab waveguide (4) to the focal distance of the second slab waveguide (6).</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>Un multiplexeur/démultiplexeur optique (1) comporte plusieurs premiers guides d'onde (3), un premier guide d'onde bidimensionnel (4), un réseau de diffraction de (5) guides d'onde groupés, un deuxième guide d'onde bidimensionnel (6) et plusieurs deuxièmes guides d'onde (7), les guides d'onde étant connectés dans cet ordre. Le rapport entre l'intervalle entre les premiers guides d'onde (3) par rapport au premier guide d'onde bidimensionnel (4) et l'intervalle entre les deuxièmes guides d'onde (7) par rapport au deuxième guide d'onde bidimensionnel (6) est différent du rapport entre la distance focale du premier guide d'onde bidirectionnel (4) et la distance focale du deuxième guide d'onde bidirectionnel (6).</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>